Error [jet.InvalidImageFrom]: This `Image` has no `from`
  --> config.jet:1:21
    |
  1 | module m { image.i: { format: iso } }
    |                     ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^
 Why: Active Jetpack images are OCI containers built from a package; `system.*` disk images are frozen jetos research
 Fix: Add `from: packages.<name>` for an `.Oci` image
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0977
